QuickAssist
===========

QuickAssist is a modified version of SimpleAssist, a World of Warcraft addon
by Schnoggo (published on CurseForge as LonMakes).

Modified by:     Terrorskull (QuickAssist 0.1.0, for WoW Forever)

Original work:   SimpleAssist 4.01
Original author: Schnoggo
Original source: https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/simpleassist
                 https://www.wowinterface.com/downloads/fileinfo.php?id=7814

